# Advert pillar (R23 street, plaza): a round ink column with two cyan screen bands and a magenta crown ring.
grid 5
size 16 16 70
slot body Ink
slot band NeonCyan
slot edge NeonCyanEdge
slot crown PaperEdge
cyl 8 8 0 66 6 body
paint cyl 8 8 30 42 6.5 band
paint cyl 8 8 29 30 6.5 edge
paint cyl 8 8 42 43 6.5 edge
paint cyl 8 8 50 56 6.5 band
cyl 8 8 66 68 7 body
cyl 8 8 68 69 7 crown
